  "id": "BIT-kyverno-2026-100707",
  "summary": "Kyverno before 1.19.1 Namespace Isolation Bypass via Percent-Encoded Path",
  "details": "Kyverno before 1.19.1 contains a namespace isolation bypass in the apiCall context entry of namespaced Policy resources due to inconsistent path interpretation between validation and execution. A low-privilege tenant can use percent-encoded dot-segments in urlPath to bypass namespace checks and read resources from other namespaces using the Kyverno admission controller's ServiceAccount credentials.",
